 150 /	C)	IDNUM - EVERY CONTROLLER WITHIN THIS SYSTEM (KNOWN  AS  SASI  OR SCSI)
 160 /	REQUIRES AN ID NUMBER OR UNIQUE TARGET DEVICE ADDRESS.    THE  HANDLER MUST BE
 170 /	ASSEMBLED  FOR  A KNOWN ID NUMBER WHICH WILL PARTIALLY DETERMINE  THE  HANDLER
 180 /	NAME.  UP TO EIGHT ID NUMBERS (0-7) ARE ALLOWED.
